<Layout title="Drylining Kirkcaldy | Partition Walls &amp; Ceilings Contractors" description="Professional drylining contractors in Kirkcaldy. Expert partition walls, suspended ceilings, and plasterboard installation for Kirkcaldy, Fife, and the wider KY1–KY16 postcode region. Free quotes." canonical="/areas/kirkcaldy/" schema={schema}>
  <section style="position:relative;min-height:400px;display:flex;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1a2e 0%,#16213e 100%);overflow:hidden;"> <img src="/images/hero-main.jpg" alt="Drylining services in Kirkcaldy and Fife" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;opacity:0.25;"> <div class="container" style="position:relative;z-index:1;text-align:center;padding:60px 20px;"> <nav style="font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.70);margin-bottom:12px;"> <a href="/" style="text-decoration:none;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.70);">Home</a> / <a href="/areas/" style="text-decoration:none;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.70);">Areas</a> / <span style="color:#ffffff;">Drylining in Kirkcaldy</span> </nav> <h1 style="font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);font-weight:800;color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.15;">Drylining in Kirkcaldy</h1> <p style="font-size:17px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.6;">CSCS-accredited drylining contractors delivering partition walls, suspended ceilings, and plasterboard across Kirkcaldy, Fife, and the wider KY1–KY16 postcode region.</p> </div> </section> <section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:900px;"> <div style="padding:24px;margin-bottom:24px;border-left:4px solid var(--primary);background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--border);"> <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;color:var(--text);"><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Drylining Kirkcaldy provides drylining, partition walls, and suspended ceilings across Kirkcaldy (KY1–KY16), Fife, and the wider area. Experienced with coastal properties, shopping centre refurbishments, and residential developments in Fife's largest town.</p> </div> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Drylining Services in Kirkcaldy</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Kirkcaldy is Fife's largest town, situated approximately 15 miles north-east of Edinburgh city centre on the Firth of Forth coast. The KY1–KY16 postcode areas cover the historic town centre with its famous Lawnmarket and High Street, the South Leven coastal corridor, and surrounding residential and industrial areas. Kirkcaldy has a population of around 33,000 and serves as a major commercial and retail hub for the North East Fife region. The town's position at the heart of the Fife beltway and its strong transport links — including the A92 coastal road and direct rail connections to Edinburgh — make it a popular base for contractors serving both the Fife and Lothians areas. As Fife's largest town, Kirkcaldy has seen significant retail, commercial, and residential development, creating consistent demand for quality drylining services across the wider KY postcode region.</p> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">The area offers a distinctive mix of projects for our drylining team — from the careful internal refurbishment of period properties in the Lawnmarket and High Street area to modern commercial fit-outs at the Fife Shopping Centre and surrounding business parks. We cover the entire KY1–KY16 postcode region, serving everything from single-room domestic projects in period properties to larger commercial fit-outs along the coastal corridor. All work is carried out to Scottish Building Standards compliant with all relevant sections.</p> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">What We Do in Kirkcaldy</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Our Kirkcaldy crew handles everything from historic town centre property conversions to large-scale commercial fit-outs — covering partition walls, suspended ceilings, and fire-rated wall systems across the KY1–KY16 postcode and Fife.</p> <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <li><strong>Historic property drylining</strong> — Internal wall insulation, room conversions, and partition walls in Kirkcaldy's period properties along the Lawnmarket, High Street, and coastal areas</li> <li><strong>Commercial fit-outs</strong> — Office refurbs, retail units, and hospitality venues at the Fife Shopping Centre, High Street, and business parks</li> <li><strong>Coastal property drylining</strong> — Internal wall insulation and moisture-resistant dry lining for properties along the South Leven coastal corridor</li> <li><strong>Fire-rated walls</strong> — Multi-storey residential and commercial buildings requiring Scottish Building Standards Section 2 (Fire) compliance</li> <li><strong>Suspended ceilings</strong> — Commercial premises, offices, education facilities, and retail developments across Fife</li> <li><strong>Acoustic partitions</strong> — Residential properties, mixed-use developments, and commercial spaces in Kirkcaldy and surrounding Fife areas</li> </ul> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Areas of Kirkcaldy We Cover</h2> <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <li>Kirkcaldy town centre (KY1) — Lawnmarket, High Street, St James Street</li> <li>South Leven and coastal area (KY1/KY12)</li> <li>Glenrothes Road and commercial estates (KY1/KY2)</li> <li>West Burnside (KY1/KY2)</li> <li>East Burnside (KY1/KY2)</li> <li>Kingseat and Markinch (KY14/KY15)</li> <li>Dunfermline (KY1/KY12) — 15 minutes via A92</li> <li>Glenrothes (KY6/KY7) — 10 minutes via A92</li> <li>Leven (KY8) — 15 minutes via A92</li> <li>Fife area generally</li> </ul> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Kirkcaldy Building Regulations &amp; Planning</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Kirkcaldy falls under <strong>Fife Council</strong> for building standards and planning. The town centre contains numerous Category A, B, and C listed buildings, particularly properties along the Lawnmarket and High Street that are within conservation areas. Internal structural alterations in listed buildings require listed building consent from the council. We work closely with clients, architects, and the council's building standards department to ensure every project — from a simple room partition in a historic town centre property to a commercial fit-out at the Fife Shopping Centre — is fully compliant with Scottish Building Standards and any additional conservation requirements.</p> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Why Choose Us for Kirkcaldy Projects</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">As an Edinburgh-based drylining team, we have extensive experience working across Fife, including Kirkcaldy, Dunfermline, and Glenrothes. We understand the unique character of Kirkcaldy — from its historic town centre and coastal properties to the modern commercial developments driving growth in the town centre. Our crew is familiar with Scottish Building Standards and the particular requirements of working in Fife's largest town. Whether you need drylining for a period property conversion, a commercial fit-out, or a coastal property refurbishment, our team delivers quality work on time and within budget.</p> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Related Services</h2> <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <a href="/services/partition-walls/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Partition Walls</a> <a href="/services/fire-rated-drylining/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Fire-Rated Drylining</a> <a href="/services/acoustic-drylining/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Acoustic Drylining</a> <a href="/services/refurbishment-drylining/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Refurbishment Drylining</a> </div> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Nearby Areas</h2> <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <li><a href="/areas/dunfermline/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Dunfermline</a> — 15 minutes via A92</li> <li><a href="/areas/glenrothes/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Glenrothes</a> — 10 minutes via A92</li> <li><a href="/areas/edinburgh/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Edinburgh</a> — 25 minutes via A92/M90</li> <li><a href="/areas/leven/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Leven</a> — 15 minutes via A92</li> </ul> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Get a Free Kirkcaldy Quote</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:2rem;">We offer free, no-obligation site visits and written quotes for all drylining projects across Kirkcaldy. Call us or fill in our quick form.</p> <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center;"> <a href="/get-quote/" class="btn btn-primary" style="font-size:1.0625rem;padding:1rem 2.5rem;">Get a Free Kirkcaldy Quote</a> <a href="tel:08008203090" class="btn btn-secondary" style="font-size:1.0625rem;padding:1rem 2.5rem;border:2px solid var(--primary);background:transparent;color:var(--primary);margin-left:0.5rem;">FREEPHONE 0800 820 3090</a> </div> </div></section>  
</Layout>